         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">MBRB1545CT - Switch-mode Power Rectifier D2PAK Surface Mount Power Package</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li>onsemi</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The D2PAK Power Rectifier employs the Schottky Barrier principle with a platinum barrier metal. These stateâ€ofâ€theâ€art devices have the following features:&#xA;Features&#xA;â€¢â€‡Center-Tap Configuration&#xA;â€¢â€‡Guardring for Stress Protection&#xA;â€¢â€‡Low Forward Voltage&#xA;â€¢â€‡175Â°C Operating Junction Temperature&#xA;â€¢â€‡Epoxy Meets UL 94, V-0 @ 0.125 in&#xA;â€¢â€‡Short Heatsink Tab Manufactured - Not Sheared&#xA;â€¢â€‡Similar in Size to the Industry Standard TO220 Package&#xA;â€¢â€‡SBRB Prefix for Automotive and Other Applications Requiring Unique Site and Control Change Requirements; AEC-Q101 Qualified and PPAP Capable&#xA;â€¢â€‡These Devices are Pb-Free and are RoHS Compliant*</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <pdf:Producer>Acrobat Distiller 24.0 (Windows)</pdf:Producer>
